2026-07-28T17:39:56.817635675Z INFO:src.agent.brainstorming.nodes:feedback graph message [ai]: [{'text': "Perfect! I've staged your labeler configuration for approval:\n\n**From-Scratch Baking Community Standards**\n\n1. **From-Scratch Ethos** — A visible informational badge (nothing hidden) that marks posts exemplifying your values: naturally-leavened, from-scratch baking with wild starter, home-milled flour, and traditional methods. Newcomers can spot what your community is about.\n\n2. **Product Spam** — Hides posts behind a click-through with a notice explaining they appear to be product spam that falls outside your community norms. Subscribers can still view them if they choose.\n\nThe group will now review and approve this configuration. Once approved, you'll move to the next step: defining the specific signals (keywords, patterns, account traits) that trigger each label.", 'type': 'text', 'index': 0}]
