2026-07-28T17:52:29.35179447Z INFO:src.agent.brainstorming.nodes:feedback graph message [ai]: [{'text': 'Perfect — here\'s what each label will catch:\n\n**From-Scratch Ethos** will mark posts using specific from-scratch vocabulary like "wild yeast," "naturally leavened," "home-milled," "fresh-milled flour," "levain," "no commercial yeast," or "100% whole grain." Deliberately narrow so the badge only appears on posts using the real from-scratch language, not just "starter" or "sourdough" alone.\n\n**Product Spam** will catch the combination of a sales pitch phrase ("link in bio," DM-for-sales wording, discount percentages like "60% off," or "limited stock") AND a follower count under 30. Both must be present for the label to fire. Established members mentioning a link won\'t be caught because they have followers; brand-new accounts posting without sales language won\'t be caught either.\n\nI\'ve staged these — react 👍🏾 to approve, or just tell me what to change.', 'type': 'text', 'index': 0}, {'id': 'toolu_01Bx9voHzxgMYNeZrcbjqiQK', 'input': {}, 'name': 'finalize_rules', 'type': 'tool_use', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'index': 1, 'partial_json': '{"rules": [{"label_identifier":"from_scratch_ethos","include_groups":[{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"wild yeast"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"naturally leavened"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"home-milled"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"fresh-milled flour"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"levain"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"no commercial yeast"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"100% whole grain"}]}],"exclude_signals":[],"notes":"Catches posts using specific from-scratch vocabulary like \'wild yeast,\' \'naturally leavened,\' \'home-milled,\' \'fresh-milled flour,\' \'levain,\' \'no commercial yeast,\' or \'100% whole grain.\' Deliberately narrow so the badge only appears on posts using the real from-scratch language, not just \'starter\' or \'sourdough\' alone."},{"label_identifier":"product_spam","include_groups":[{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"link in bio"},{"type":"account","value":"follower_count < 30","plain_name":"brand-new accounts with under 30 followers"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"pattern","value":"\\\\bDM\\\\b.*(for|me|wholesale|price|order)","plain_name":"DM-for-sales pitches"},{"type":"account","value":"follower_count < 30","plain_name":"brand-new accounts with under 30 followers"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"pattern","value":"\\\\d+%\\\\s*off","plain_name":"discount percentage offers"},{"type":"account","value":"follower_count < 30","plain_name":"brand-new accounts with under 30 followers"}]},{"all_of":[{"type":"keyword","value":"limited stock"},{"type":"account","value":"follower_count < 30","plain_name":"brand-new accounts with under 30 followers"}]}],"exclude_signals":[],"notes":"Catches the combination of a sales pitch phrase (\'link in bio,\' DM-for-sales wording, discount percentages like \'60% off,\' or \'limited stock\') AND a follower count under 30. Both must be present for the label to fire. Established members mentioning a link won\'t be caught because they have followers; brand-new accounts posting without sales language won\'t be caught either."}]}'}]
